<title>JAPAN: Nihon Cement - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Cement - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 99.46		vs	   94.32</p>
<p> Operating     prft 2.69		vs     loss 3.05</p>
<p> Current		1.26		vs	   84    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.85		vs	  833    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.61 yen	  vs	    2.54 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    330 million	  vs	 328 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Cement Co Ltd is a member of the Fuyo group.</p>
